1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
一头牛，能涮火锅的不到三成
Under 30% of a cow makes the pot

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
潮汕人，把它切成十几个部位
Chaoshan splits it into a dozen cuts

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
脖仁、吊龙、匙柄、胸口朥
Neck, sirloin, spoon-shank, chest fat

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,200
每个部位，肥瘦纹理都不同
Each cut: its own fat and grain

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,500
吊龙最嫩，涮八秒就够
Sirloin's tender — eight seconds, done

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
胸口朥够厚，要涮五分钟
Chest fat's thick — a full five minutes

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,100
规矩：当天现宰，绝不隔夜
Rule: slaughtered same day, never frozen

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,400
一锅清汤，只放牛骨白萝卜
Clear broth — just beef bone and radish

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,700
沙茶酱一蘸，潮汕话喊：正！
Dip in sacha — 'zià', perfect!

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,000
不靠辣，靠一个字：鲜
No chili — one word: fresh

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,300
火锅分几派？这派吃的是刀工
Hotpot schools? This one's the knife

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,600
下集：北京铜锅，清水也封神
Next: Beijing copper pot — clear water, legendary
